1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:09,480
We are in the busy pedestrian
street of Świdnicka.

2
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:15,620
It's noisy, it's lively,
it's full of people, it's bustling.

3
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:22,320
However, if you walk just inside
the space behind me through that door,

4
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:28,280
you will reach a piece of heaven,

5
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:32,720
a piece of serenity
in which you can relax

6
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:37,060
and enjoy a modern art exhibition

7
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:43,100
and places just to sit
and enjoy a cup of tea,

8
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:47,220
just like you are
in your living room.

9
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:51,320
Rest and just admire

10
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:57,400
the beautiful artistic artifacts

11
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:01,060
that are around you in the space.

12
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:06,300
The exhibition is presenting
different artists

13
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:12,440
and it's seasonal,
it's changing through the year.

14
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:17,600
So I invite you to visit
this amazing gallery

15
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,780
and it's for free.

16
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,100
See you on our next video.
